<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-fractofusus-misrai-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg–Turing wavelength for Fractofusus misrai at 63 µm (565 Ma) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 80/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The comparison figure places the CC BY Mistaken Point mould beside a siltstone spindle. Bedding colour and an elongate central body are shared. The model's interior is a spot lattice with a weak chevron, while the fossil's vanes are oblique and continuous, so this is not a registered overlay. Computer-vision similarity of the 12-frame GIF against the photograph is 79.4." ;
